# LCV-171 AC 3/AC 11 — an Inkscape-style file with geometry in <defs>. The
# <defs> path and gradient are never rendered, so they import nothing and
# <defs> is reported once (it has element children). <sodipodi:namedview> and
# <metadata> are silent; inkscape:* attributes are outside the SVG namespace.
# The layer <g> has no `data-layer`: geometry lands on the default `Cut` layer,
# and its identity `transform` is applied, not reported (LCV-173). The <image>
# is skipped and reported. `style="fill:none;…"` is exempt.
# World y = 100 - svg y.
bed 100 100
layer "Cut" #ff0000 output=1 current=1
line 0 10 10 90 10
# M (30, 50) to (70, 50): a half turn (chord 40 = 2r), centre svg (50, 50)
# = world (50, 50). sweep 1 = clockwise on screen: from the left (180 deg)
# over the top to the right (0 deg), clockwise.
arc 0 50 50 20 180 0 cw
ignored 1 defs
ignored 1 image
